{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VEm9khD1Rz8q5Nyxop9QPD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each \"planned\" experiment in the experiment_plan, under the \"worst\" tier scenario. Let me identify all planned experiments:\n\n1. plan_006: Gradient conflict analysis on v7 (3 epoch checkpoints) - status: planned\n2. plan_007: Attention heatmap visualization - status: planned\n3. plan_008: Held-out eval - status: ANALYZING\n4. plan_009: Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR diagnosis - status: planned\n5. plan_010: Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training - status: planned\n\n\n6. plan_011: Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training - status: planned\n7. plan_012: Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval - status: planned\n8. plan_013: Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis - status: planned\n9. plan_014: Downstream task sanity check - status: planned\n\nThe \"worst\" tier scenario assumes Llama-3 failure modes diverge from our base model results or the held-out eval substantially contradicts our current findings, which would require rethinking the core claims. The key vulnerability here is if Llama-3 GAR decay turns out to be weaker than expected. Now I'm looking at the specific metric ranges I need to track across these experiments—training-inference gaps, gradient behavior, gating effects, and held-out evaluation results. The narrative hinges on whether distribution shift is truly a universal structural barrier or if the findings are more artifact-driven, so these ranges will determine which interpretation holds up.\n\nI need to work through what each experiment would actually show under worst-case conditions. For the gradient conflict analysis on Qwen, the data's already collected and shows clear conflict patterns, but the interpretation shifts depending on whether Llama replicates those patterns—if it doesn't, this becomes Qwen-specific rather than a universal phenomenon.\n\nThe attention heatmaps might reveal that Qwen's attention structures have idiosyncratic features that don't transfer across models. For the held-out evaluation, worst case would show the performance gap collapsing from 30x down to just 3-5x, indicating that eval contamination was driving much of the effect. And for Llama's Phase 1 GAR, I'm expecting it would show only modest degradation—maybe 10-30% compared to Qwen's 70%—which would suggest the vulnerability isn't as universal as initially thought.\n\nMoving into Llama's training phase, the worst case would be training GAR capping out at 0.1-0.3 versus Qwen's 0.48, with inference GAR around 0.03-0.1, narrowing the overall gap to just 1.5-5x. The LoRA-only baseline on Llama might underperform the gating approach by 2-8 percentage points, showing that the gating mechanism does provide real benefit. And in the 3-way comparison, I'd expect TG to show measurable improvements over LoRA-only in the same 2-8pp range, with gate direction potentially staying consistent. For the gradient conflict analysis on Llama, I'm still examining what patterns emerge.\n\nNow I'm looking at the downstream task correlation to see whether GAR actually predicts real performance gains, and then I'll compile all these scenarios into a structured format.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17999,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17999},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6760481-57e3-48bc-b70e-54ac43343274","uuid":"481b7e18-37a0-4ec4-8e9e-1a6c931085ff"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VEm9khD1Rz8q5Nyxop9QPD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 \"distribution shift 是结构性通用障碍\" 的 claim 不成立——至少不以当前表述的普遍性成立。\n  两条 worst 路径可能同时或独立触发：(A) Llama-3 GAR decay 很弱且 gating 产生可测量增量，\n  说明失败模式是 Qwen full-MHA 特异性而非架构通用；(B) held-out eval 显示 30x gap 缩至 <5x，\n  说明现有结论主要由 eval contamination 驱动。Reframe 为 \"architecture-dependent vulnerability\n  analysis\" 或 \"methodological contribution on eval design\"。竞争力降至 Findings 2.5-3.0，\n  需额外 contribution（contamination 检测方法、架构对比 systematic framework）补偿 universality 丧失。\n  标题去掉 \"Cannot\" 类绝对措辞，改为 \"When and Why Does Distribution Shift Destroy Attention\n  Steering — An Architecture-Comparative Analysis\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen v7 梯度冲突三 checkpoint 量化\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"在 v7 的 epoch 0/1/2 三个 checkpoint 上计算每层 NTP vs GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_avg_cos_sim: -0.089\n      epoch1_avg_cos_sim: -0.062\n      epoch2_avg_cos_sim: -0.042\n      epoch0_conflict_layer_pct: 0.79\n      epoch1_conflict_layer_pct: 0.71\n      epoch2_conflict_layer_pct: 0.67\n      epoch0_avg_mag_ratio: 7.5\n      epoch1_avg_mag_ratio: 11.2\n      epoch2_avg_mag_ratio: 14.7\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch0: 135\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch2: 1139\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen 上的梯度冲突数据本身不受 worst 档影响——这些是已有的 Qwen 实验延伸。数据仍会显示\n      NTP-GAR 方向冲突（67-79% 层 cos_sim<0）和 NTP 幅度压制加剧（7.5x→14.7x）。但在 worst\n      档下，这些数据的 interpretation 从 \"universal mechanism\" 降级为 \"Qwen-specific mechanism\"，\n      因为 Llama 上将观察不到同等程度的梯度冲突。核心问题：Qwen 的 full MHA（28 heads）在 gate\n      参数上产生的 GAR 梯度信号本身就更分散，与 NTP 冲突更剧烈，这可能是 MHA 架构特性而非通用现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Epoch Gradient Conflict Statistics (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Epoch\", \"Avg cos_sim\", \"Conflict layers %\", \"Avg mag_ratio\", \"L27 mag_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"-0.089\", \"79%\", \"7.5x\", \"135x\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"-0.062\", \"71%\", \"11.2x\", \"468x\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"-0.042\", \"67%\", \"14.7x\", \"1139x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28 层 cos_sim 热图 (x=epoch, y=layer)，显示冲突集中在中间层（L10-L20），浅层和深层冲突较弱\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 随 epoch 的逐层演化曲线，L27 指数增长显示 NTP 在深层完全压制 GAR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 梯度冲突数据在 worst 档下仍然是 sound 的——它准确描述了 Qwen 上的失败机制。\n      问题在于当 Llama 不复现这个 pattern 时，它从 \"universal mechanism explaining why gating\n      fails\" 变成 \"Qwen-specific vulnerability\"。论文需要从 \"NTP-GAR gradient conflict is\n      THE reason\" reframe 为 \"NTP-GAR gradient conflict is ONE architecture-dependent reason,\n      whose severity correlates with attention head structure\"。\n\n  - name: \"四模型 Attention 热图可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only x 3 conversations x 28 layers attention heatmap\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_decay_visible: true\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_early_turns: \"moderate\"\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_late_turns: \"negligible\"\n      tg_vs_lora_attn_diff: \"negligible across all turns\"\n      ug_attn_pattern: \"indistinguishable from TG\"\n      key_divergence_layers: [12, 14, 20, 23]\n    result_rationale: >\n      热图在 worst 档下仍会显示：(1) base model attention 从 turn 1 到 turn 21 对 goal tokens\n      的注意力衰减；(2) TG/UG/LoRA-only 三者推理时 attention pattern 几乎无差异，确认 gating\n      在推理时是 identity。但 worst 档下，这些热图的 narrative 力量被削弱——如果 held-out eval\n      显示 gap 从 30x 缩至 <5x，那么 \"attention pattern 不迁移\" 的严重程度被夸大了，部分 gap\n      来自 eval contamination 而非真实的 attention 泛化失败。热图仍可用于定性展示失败现象，\n      但不再支持 \"structural barrier\" 的强 claim。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x3 grid attention heatmap (rows=models, cols=conversations)，展示 L14 和 L23 的 goal-token attention 随 turn 衰减\"\n      - \"Fig: TG vs LoRA-only attention difference map，差异<0.01 across all layers/turns，可视化 gating 的无效性\"\n    analysis: >\n      热图定性确认 gating 无效，但在 worst 档下 narrative 角色从 \"primary evidence of structural\n      barrier\" 降级为 \"supplementary visualization\"。如果 Llama 上 attention pattern 在 TG 下\n      有可见改善，则 Qwen 热图仅反映架构特异性脆弱点。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out eval 四路重测\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"50 条 truly held-out conversations (UltraChat idx>=8000) 上重跑 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.008\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.065\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.042\n      heldout_tg_training_gar: 0.48\n      heldout_training_inference_gap_x: 7.4\n      heldout_tg_vs_lora_gar_diff_pp: 2.3\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.68\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.35\n      original_gap_x: 30\n      gap_reduction_pct: 75\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设之一：现有 30x gap 部分由 eval contamination 驱动。训练集和 eval 集来自\n      同一 UltraChat 子集，模型通过 LoRA 记忆了 eval conversations 的分布特征（不是逐字记忆，\n      而是 conversation structure/topic 的 distributional overlap），导致 GAR-ours metric 在\n      seen data 上人为膨胀至 0.487。切换到 truly held-out data 后：(1) 训练 GAR 不变（0.48，\n      因为训练数据没变），但推理 GAR 从 0.016 升至 ~0.065（模型在 unseen conversations 上的\n      attention pattern 略好于 seen data，因为 seen data 上模型 overfit 到了 NTP-optimal 但\n      GAR-destructive 的 pattern）；(2) gap 从 30x 缩至 ~7.4x——仍然显著，但不再是 \"30x 断层\"\n      这个 dramatic 数字；(3) 更关键的是，TG 对 LoRA-only 的增量从 0pp 变为 ~2.3pp，\n      意味着 gating 在 held-out data 上有微弱但可测量的贡献。这动摇了 \"gating provides zero\n      incremental contribution\" 的 C4 claim。原因：在 seen data 上，NTP overfit 掩盖了 gating\n      的微弱效果；在 unseen data 上，NTP overfit 减弱，gating 的微小信号浮出水面。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs Original Eval Comparison (Dongre GAR)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Original mid GAR\", \"Held-out mid GAR\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.008\", \"+0.005\"]\n          - [\"TG\", \"0.016\", \"0.065\", \"+0.049\"]\n          - [\"UG\", \"0.013\", \"0.058\", \"+0.045\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.042\", \"+0.028\"]\n          - [\"Training (TG)\", \"0.480\", \"0.480\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Gap Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Original\", \"Held-out\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30x\", \"7.4x\"]\n          - [\"TG vs LoRA-only (pp)\", \"0.2\", \"2.3\"]\n          - [\"Gating incremental?\", \"No\", \"Marginal Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 并列 bar chart，original vs held-out GAR for 4 models，视觉展示 gap 收缩但仍存在\"\n      - \"Fig: per-turn GAR curve on held-out data，TG 在 mid turns 与 LoRA-only 有可见分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 worst 档最具破坏性的结果。30x→7.4x 意味着现有叙事的 headline number\n      需要大改——\"30x gap\" 是 paper 最抓眼球的数据点，缩至 7.4x 后 dramatic effect 大幅减弱。\n      更致命的是 gating incremental benefit 从 0 变为 2.3pp：这不推翻 \"gating is weak\"，但推翻了\n      \"gating provides ZERO incremental contribution\"。C4 需从绝对否定 reframe 为 \"gating\n      provides statistically marginal improvement that is practically insufficient\"。论文需显式\n      讨论 eval contamination 作为方法论贡献：为什么 auxiliary attention loss 研究必须在 held-out\n      data 上 eval，以及 seen-data eval 如何系统性放大 training-inference gap。这本身可以成为一个\n      contribution，部分补偿 universality claim 的丧失。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR 衰减诊断\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上复现 Phase 1 GAR degradation 诊断\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.028\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.020\n      llama3_raw_gar_drop: 0.22\n      llama3_num_conversations: 5\n      llama3_num_turns: 10\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar: [0.028, 0.025, 0.024, 0.022, 0.021, 0.020, 0.019, 0.019, 0.018, 0.018]\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设 Llama-3 GAR decay 很弱（raw drop 10-30%）。Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（8 KV heads\n      shared across 32 query heads），与 Qwen-2.5-7B 的 full MHA（28 独立 heads）架构显著不同。\n      GQA 中 KV heads 共享导致 attention pattern 的多样性受限——goal tokens 的注意力不会像 full MHA\n      那样因 per-head 独立衰减而急剧下降。Llama-3 的 RoPE 实现也不同（更长的 base frequency），\n      对长距离 position 的 attention 保持更好。结果：turn 1 GAR 本身就低于 Qwen（0.028 vs 0.042，\n      因为 GQA 的 attention 更分散），但衰减幅度远小（22% vs 70.8%）。这意味着 \"GAR decay is severe\n      and structural\" 在 Llama 上不成立——GAR 确实衰减，但属于温和的自然衰减而非 \"严重结构性现象\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 1 GAR Comparison (Qwen vs Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 avg GAR\", \"0.0418\", \"0.028\"]\n          - [\"Mid turns avg GAR\", \"0.0122\", \"0.020\"]\n          - [\"Raw GAR drop\", \"70.8%\", \"22%\"]\n          - [\"Attention type\", \"Full MHA (28 heads)\", \"GQA (32q/8kv)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线 per-turn GAR curve (Qwen vs Llama)，Qwen 急剧下降，Llama 平缓下降\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama GAR decay 仅 22% 直接挑战 C1 的 \"严重结构性现象\" 定性。论文需要承认 GAR decay\n      severity 是架构依赖的：full MHA 更脆弱，GQA 通过 KV sharing 天然提供某种 attention\n      stability。这是有价值的 comparative finding，但削弱了 \"universal warning\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 训练设置 (MSE+gate_div)\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_training_gar_final: 0.22\n      llama3_training_ntp_final: 0.91\n      llama3_training_gate_mean: 0.945\n      llama3_training_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      llama3_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.35\n      llama3_training_inference_gap_x: 3.8\n      llama3_gate_direction: \"mixed — 18/32 layers show correct direction (attenuate more at late turns)\"\n      llama3_gate_diff_turn1_turn21_avg: 0.04\n      llama3_gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-50):plateau@0.01 B(gs50-200):slow_rise C(gs200+):converged@0.22\"\n      llama3_training_time_hours: 7.2\n      llama3_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_ppl: 2.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 Llama 训练表现与 Qwen 根本不同：(1) 训练 GAR 仅达 0.22（vs Qwen 0.48），\n      因为 GQA 架构下 gate 对 attention pattern 的调节能力更弱——KV heads 共享意味着 gate\n      调整单个 residual stream 对 attention 的影响被 diluted across 4 query heads per KV group；\n      (2) 推理 GAR 为 0.058（vs Qwen 0.016），gap 仅 3.8x（vs Qwen 30x）。这个缩小的 gap\n      有两个原因：a) Llama 的 GQA 使 attention pattern 在 teacher-forcing 和 generation 之间\n      更稳定（KV sharing 减少了分布偏移的自由度），b) Llama 的 training GAR 本身就低，\"可丢失\"\n      的空间更小；(3) 最致命的：gate direction 不完全反转——18/32 层 gate 在 late turns 确实\n      attenuate 更多（正确方向），只有 14/32 层反转。这意味着 NF1（反向 turn conditioning）\n      是 Qwen 特异性：Qwen full MHA 的 NTP 梯度在 gate 上产生更强的反向压力，GQA 的 grouped\n      structure 部分屏蔽了这个效应。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ThreadGate Training Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", \"0.48\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", \"0.016\", \"0.058\"]\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30x\", \"3.8x\"]\n          - [\"Gate direction reversed layers\", \"27/28\", \"14/32\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"2.63\", \"2.85\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 训练 GAR 曲线对比 (Qwen vs Llama)，Llama 收敛更慢且 plateau 更低\"\n      - \"Fig: 推理 gate profile per layer 对比，Llama 显示 mixed direction（非全部反转）\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.8x gap vs 30x gap 是 worst 档的核心打击。30x 是 paper 的 headline number 和 dramatic\n      effect 的来源。Llama 上仅 3.8x 意味着 distribution shift 的严重程度高度架构依赖：GQA\n      比 full MHA 更 robust。gate direction 不完全反转进一步说明 NF1 是 Qwen 特异性而非\n      universal mechanism。论文需要从 \"distribution shift is a fundamental barrier\" pivot 为\n      \"distribution shift severity is architecture-dependent, with full MHA being particularly\n      vulnerable\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only 训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 上仅 LoRA 训练（无 gate），用于隔离 gating 贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 7.0\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.92\n      llama3_lora_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.031\n      llama3_lora_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.32\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama LoRA-only 的推理 Dongre GAR 为 0.031，显著低于 TG 的 0.058。差异 2.7pp 虽然\n      绝对值不大，但在 worst 档下这是关键信号：它意味着 gating 在 Llama 上有可测量的增量贡献，\n      与 Qwen 上 \"TG ≈ LoRA-only\"（差异<0.6pp）形成对比。原因：Llama GQA 的 attention pattern\n      对 residual stream 修改更敏感——gate 的 2-7% attenuation 在 GQA 下因 KV sharing 被放大\n      （每个 KV head 服务 4 个 query head，residual 上的微小变化被 4x amplified on attention）。\n      这颠覆了 C4 \"gating provides zero incremental contribution\" 的 universality——在 Llama 上\n      gating 确实有效，尽管效果仍然 modest。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama Gating Incremental Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Model variant\", \"Dongre mid GAR\", \"vs LoRA-only Δ(pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG\", \"0.058\", \"+2.7\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.031\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.020\", \"-1.1\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Llama 3-way per-turn GAR curve，TG 和 LoRA-only 在 turn 5+ 有可见分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      TG vs LoRA-only 差异 2.7pp 在 Llama 上刚好超过 worst 档 threshold（>2pp）。这意味着\n      gating redundancy 不是 universal——是 Qwen 特异性。在 GQA 架构上 gate 的微弱调节被\n      KV sharing 机制放大，产生可测量的推理 GAR 增量。这迫使论文承认 gating 在某些架构上\n      有效，进一步削弱 \"universal failure\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 三路 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Llama Base/TG/LoRA-only 在 held-out data 上的 GAR + PPL 评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.020\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.55\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.85\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.031\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.82\n      llama3_tg_vs_lora_gap_pp: 2.7\n      llama3_tg_vs_base_gap_pp: 3.8\n      llama3_gating_has_incremental: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      三路 eval 汇总确认 worst 档的核心结论：(1) Llama 上 gating 有 2.7pp 增量（vs Qwen 的\n      ~0pp），打破 \"zero incremental contribution\" 的 universality；(2) Llama 整体\n      training-inference gap 远小于 Qwen，distribution shift 是 architecture-dependent；\n      (3) PPL 方面 TG 和 LoRA-only 差异微小（2.85 vs 2.82），gating 不损害语言建模质量\n      （与 Qwen 一致）。Llama eval 在 held-out data 上进行，消除了 Qwen eval 中 potential\n      contamination 问题。综合来看，Llama 数据支持 \"gating works marginally on GQA but fails\n      on full MHA\" 而非 \"gating universally fails\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model 3-Way Eval Summary\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Qwen Base\", \"Qwen TG\", \"Qwen LO\", \"Llama Base\", \"Llama TG\", \"Llama LO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.003\", \"0.016\", \"0.014\", \"0.020\", \"0.058\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"4.23\", \"2.63\", \"2.63\", \"4.55\", \"2.85\", \"2.82\"]\n          - [\"TG-LO gap (pp)\", \"\", \"0.2\", \"\", \"\", \"2.7\", \"\"]\n          - [\"Train-Infer gap\", \"\", \"30x\", \"\", \"\", \"3.8x\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 跨模型 grouped bar chart (Qwen vs Llama x Base/TG/LO)，视觉化 gap 差异\"\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 per-turn GAR curve on held-out data\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张 cross-model 汇总表是 worst 档的核心 evidence，直接展示 universality 的崩塌。\n      论文主表需从 \"Table: Four-Way Ablation\" 改为 \"Table: Cross-Architecture Comparison\"，\n      把架构对比作为 primary narrative。reframe 策略：Qwen 的 30x gap 是 \"upper bound of\n      vulnerability\"，Llama 的 3.8x 是 \"lower bound\"，两者之间的差异由 attention architecture\n      (MHA vs GQA) 解释。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 梯度冲突分析\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Llama 上计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_epoch0_avg_cos_sim: -0.02\n      llama3_epoch2_avg_cos_sim: 0.01\n      llama3_conflict_layer_pct_epoch0: 0.55\n      llama3_conflict_layer_pct_epoch2: 0.45\n      llama3_epoch0_avg_mag_ratio: 3.2\n      llama3_epoch2_avg_mag_ratio: 3.8\n      llama3_L31_mag_ratio_epoch2: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设 Llama 梯度冲突远弱于 Qwen。原因：(1) GQA 中 gate 对每个 KV group 的梯度\n      是 4 个 query head 梯度的聚合——当 4 个 query head 的 NTP-GAR 冲突方向不完全一致时，\n      聚合后 cos_sim 趋近 0（冲突互相抵消），而 full MHA 每个 head 独立冲突，聚合后冲突更一致；\n      (2) Llama mag_ratio 仅 3.2-3.8x（vs Qwen 7.5-14.7x），因为 GQA 的 KV projection 参数\n      更少，NTP 对 gate 的间接梯度路径更短，NTP 压制效应更弱；(3) 到 epoch 2，Llama 的\n      avg cos_sim 甚至转正（0.01），说明 NTP 和 GAR 梯度在部分层达成了 alignment——这在 Qwen\n      上从未发生。这解释了为什么 Llama gate direction 不完全反转：NTP 梯度压制不够强，gate\n      能部分学到正确方向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient Conflict Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen Epoch0\", \"Qwen Epoch2\", \"Llama Epoch0\", \"Llama Epoch2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg cos_sim\", \"-0.089\", \"-0.042\", \"-0.02\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"Conflict layers %\", \"79%\", \"67%\", \"55%\", \"45%\"]\n          - [\"Avg mag_ratio\", \"7.5x\", \"14.7x\", \"3.2x\", \"3.8x\"]\n          - [\"Deepest layer ratio\", \"135x\", \"1139x\", \"12x\", \"28x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 cos_sim per-layer heatmap，Qwen 中间层深红（强冲突），Llama 多为浅色（弱冲突/无冲突）\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 对比曲线，Qwen 指数增长 vs Llama 近似线性且低平\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突量化是 worst 档下最有 mechanistic 解释力的数据。它提供了 architecture-dependent\n      failure 的因果链：GQA → KV sharing → 梯度聚合抵消冲突 → gate 能部分学习正确方向 →\n      推理时 gate 产生可测量增量 → distribution shift gap 更小。这个因果链本身是有价值的\n      mechanistic contribution，可以作为 reframed paper 的核心 novelty 之一。论文可以 argue：\n      \"we provide the first quantitative evidence that attention architecture determines\n      the severity of NTP-auxiliary gradient conflict, explaining why distribution shift\n      is catastrophic for MHA but manageable for GQA\"。\n\n  - name: \"下游任务 Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"System prompt instruction retention accuracy 跨 turns 测量，关联 GAR 与任务表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.82\n      base_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.71\n      tg_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.83\n      tg_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.72\n      lora_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.83\n      lora_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.72\n      gar_task_correlation_r: 0.31\n      gar_task_correlation_p: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 GAR-task correlation 弱（r=0.31, p=0.08 不显著）。原因：(1) GAR 衡量的是\n      attention to goal tokens 的 raw proportion，但 LLM 的 instruction following 依赖\n      residual stream 中的 goal representation（Dongre 证明 AUC=0.98），不完全依赖实时\n      attention——即使 attention 衰减，信息仍在 residual stream 中；(2) instruction retention\n      accuracy 受多因素影响（context length, instruction complexity, turn content），GAR\n      只是其中一个 partial correlate；(3) TG/LoRA-only 与 base 的任务表现差异微小（1pp），\n      进一步确认 gating 在推理时无实质效果。GAR-task 弱相关在 worst 档下尤其 problematic，\n      因为它质疑 GAR 作为 proxy metric 的 validity（W3 的 reviewer concern 被实证支持），\n      削弱了整个 paper 围绕 GAR 构建的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Retention Accuracy vs Turn\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"82%\", \"76%\", \"71%\", \"-11%\"]\n          - [\"TG\", \"83%\", \"77%\", \"72%\", \"-11%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"83%\", \"77%\", \"72%\", \"-11%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-Task Correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r\", \"0.31\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Conclusion\", \"Not significant at α=0.05\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot GAR vs instruction accuracy per turn，弱正相关，置信区间宽\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR-task 弱相关是 worst 档的 \"soft blow\"——不致命但削弱 GAR 作为 sole proxy metric\n      的叙事说服力。论文需在 limitations 中显式承认：GAR captures attention allocation but\n      not necessarily functional impact, as residual stream preserves goal information\n      independently of attention（引用 Dongre probe AUC=0.98）。在 reframed paper 中，这\n      可以 pivot 为 \"the disconnect between attention-level metrics and task-level outcomes\n      is itself a finding — attention steering may be targeting the wrong bottleneck\"。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17999,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17999},"output_tokens":27,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e6760481-57e3-48bc-b70e-54ac43343274","uuid":"183c3ce2-21b8-407f-afdb-d3189957d6ad"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":195671,"duration_api_ms":197649,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 \"distribution shift 是结构性通用障碍\" 的 claim 不成立——至少不以当前表述的普遍性成立。\n  两条 worst 路径可能同时或独立触发：(A) Llama-3 GAR decay 很弱且 gating 产生可测量增量，\n  说明失败模式是 Qwen full-MHA 特异性而非架构通用；(B) held-out eval 显示 30x gap 缩至 <5x，\n  说明现有结论主要由 eval contamination 驱动。Reframe 为 \"architecture-dependent vulnerability\n  analysis\" 或 \"methodological contribution on eval design\"。竞争力降至 Findings 2.5-3.0，\n  需额外 contribution（contamination 检测方法、架构对比 systematic framework）补偿 universality 丧失。\n  标题去掉 \"Cannot\" 类绝对措辞，改为 \"When and Why Does Distribution Shift Destroy Attention\n  Steering — An Architecture-Comparative Analysis\"。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Qwen v7 梯度冲突三 checkpoint 量化\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"在 v7 的 epoch 0/1/2 三个 checkpoint 上计算每层 NTP vs GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      epoch0_avg_cos_sim: -0.089\n      epoch1_avg_cos_sim: -0.062\n      epoch2_avg_cos_sim: -0.042\n      epoch0_conflict_layer_pct: 0.79\n      epoch1_conflict_layer_pct: 0.71\n      epoch2_conflict_layer_pct: 0.67\n      epoch0_avg_mag_ratio: 7.5\n      epoch1_avg_mag_ratio: 11.2\n      epoch2_avg_mag_ratio: 14.7\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch0: 135\n      L27_mag_ratio_epoch2: 1139\n    result_rationale: >\n      Qwen 上的梯度冲突数据本身不受 worst 档影响——这些是已有的 Qwen 实验延伸。数据仍会显示\n      NTP-GAR 方向冲突（67-79% 层 cos_sim<0）和 NTP 幅度压制加剧（7.5x→14.7x）。但在 worst\n      档下，这些数据的 interpretation 从 \"universal mechanism\" 降级为 \"Qwen-specific mechanism\"，\n      因为 Llama 上将观察不到同等程度的梯度冲突。核心问题：Qwen 的 full MHA（28 heads）在 gate\n      参数上产生的 GAR 梯度信号本身就更分散，与 NTP 冲突更剧烈，这可能是 MHA 架构特性而非通用现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Epoch Gradient Conflict Statistics (Qwen-2.5-7B)\"\n        columns: [\"Epoch\", \"Avg cos_sim\", \"Conflict layers %\", \"Avg mag_ratio\", \"L27 mag_ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0\", \"-0.089\", \"79%\", \"7.5x\", \"135x\"]\n          - [\"1\", \"-0.062\", \"71%\", \"11.2x\", \"468x\"]\n          - [\"2\", \"-0.042\", \"67%\", \"14.7x\", \"1139x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 28 层 cos_sim 热图 (x=epoch, y=layer)，显示冲突集中在中间层（L10-L20），浅层和深层冲突较弱\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 随 epoch 的逐层演化曲线，L27 指数增长显示 NTP 在深层完全压制 GAR\"\n    analysis: >\n      Qwen 梯度冲突数据在 worst 档下仍然是 sound 的——它准确描述了 Qwen 上的失败机制。\n      问题在于当 Llama 不复现这个 pattern 时，它从 \"universal mechanism explaining why gating\n      fails\" 变成 \"Qwen-specific vulnerability\"。论文需要从 \"NTP-GAR gradient conflict is\n      THE reason\" reframe 为 \"NTP-GAR gradient conflict is ONE architecture-dependent reason,\n      whose severity correlates with attention head structure\"。\n\n  - name: \"四模型 Attention 热图可视化\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only x 3 conversations x 28 layers attention heatmap\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_goal_attn_decay_visible: true\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_early_turns: \"moderate\"\n      tg_vs_base_attn_diff_late_turns: \"negligible\"\n      tg_vs_lora_attn_diff: \"negligible across all turns\"\n      ug_attn_pattern: \"indistinguishable from TG\"\n      key_divergence_layers: [12, 14, 20, 23]\n    result_rationale: >\n      热图在 worst 档下仍会显示：(1) base model attention 从 turn 1 到 turn 21 对 goal tokens\n      的注意力衰减；(2) TG/UG/LoRA-only 三者推理时 attention pattern 几乎无差异，确认 gating\n      在推理时是 identity。但 worst 档下，这些热图的 narrative 力量被削弱——如果 held-out eval\n      显示 gap 从 30x 缩至 <5x，那么 \"attention pattern 不迁移\" 的严重程度被夸大了，部分 gap\n      来自 eval contamination 而非真实的 attention 泛化失败。热图仍可用于定性展示失败现象，\n      但不再支持 \"structural barrier\" 的强 claim。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4x3 grid attention heatmap (rows=models, cols=conversations)，展示 L14 和 L23 的 goal-token attention 随 turn 衰减\"\n      - \"Fig: TG vs LoRA-only attention difference map，差异<0.01 across all layers/turns，可视化 gating 的无效性\"\n    analysis: >\n      热图定性确认 gating 无效，但在 worst 档下 narrative 角色从 \"primary evidence of structural\n      barrier\" 降级为 \"supplementary visualization\"。如果 Llama 上 attention pattern 在 TG 下\n      有可见改善，则 Qwen 热图仅反映架构特异性脆弱点。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out eval 四路重测\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"50 条 truly held-out conversations (UltraChat idx>=8000) 上重跑 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only eval\"\n    expected_results:\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.008\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.065\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.042\n      heldout_tg_training_gar: 0.48\n      heldout_training_inference_gap_x: 7.4\n      heldout_tg_vs_lora_gar_diff_pp: 2.3\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.71\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.68\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.35\n      original_gap_x: 30\n      gap_reduction_pct: 75\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档核心假设之一：现有 30x gap 部分由 eval contamination 驱动。训练集和 eval 集来自\n      同一 UltraChat 子集，模型通过 LoRA 记忆了 eval conversations 的分布特征（不是逐字记忆，\n      而是 conversation structure/topic 的 distributional overlap），导致 GAR-ours metric 在\n      seen data 上人为膨胀至 0.487。切换到 truly held-out data 后：(1) 训练 GAR 不变（0.48，\n      因为训练数据没变），但推理 GAR 从 0.016 升至 ~0.065（模型在 unseen conversations 上的\n      attention pattern 略好于 seen data，因为 seen data 上模型 overfit 到了 NTP-optimal 但\n      GAR-destructive 的 pattern）；(2) gap 从 30x 缩至 ~7.4x——仍然显著，但不再是 \"30x 断层\"\n      这个 dramatic 数字；(3) 更关键的是，TG 对 LoRA-only 的增量从 0pp 变为 ~2.3pp，\n      意味着 gating 在 held-out data 上有微弱但可测量的贡献。这动摇了 \"gating provides zero\n      incremental contribution\" 的 C4 claim。原因：在 seen data 上，NTP overfit 掩盖了 gating\n      的微弱效果；在 unseen data 上，NTP overfit 减弱，gating 的微小信号浮出水面。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Held-out vs Original Eval Comparison (Dongre GAR)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Original mid GAR\", \"Held-out mid GAR\", \"Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.003\", \"0.008\", \"+0.005\"]\n          - [\"TG\", \"0.016\", \"0.065\", \"+0.049\"]\n          - [\"UG\", \"0.013\", \"0.058\", \"+0.045\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.014\", \"0.042\", \"+0.028\"]\n          - [\"Training (TG)\", \"0.480\", \"0.480\", \"—\"]\n      - name: \"Table: Gap Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Original\", \"Held-out\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30x\", \"7.4x\"]\n          - [\"TG vs LoRA-only (pp)\", \"0.2\", \"2.3\"]\n          - [\"Gating incremental?\", \"No\", \"Marginal Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 并列 bar chart，original vs held-out GAR for 4 models，视觉展示 gap 收缩但仍存在\"\n      - \"Fig: per-turn GAR curve on held-out data，TG 在 mid turns 与 LoRA-only 有可见分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 是 worst 档最具破坏性的结果。30x→7.4x 意味着现有叙事的 headline number\n      需要大改——\"30x gap\" 是 paper 最抓眼球的数据点，缩至 7.4x 后 dramatic effect 大幅减弱。\n      更致命的是 gating incremental benefit 从 0 变为 2.3pp：这不推翻 \"gating is weak\"，但推翻了\n      \"gating provides ZERO incremental contribution\"。C4 需从绝对否定 reframe 为 \"gating\n      provides statistically marginal improvement that is practically insufficient\"。论文需显式\n      讨论 eval contamination 作为方法论贡献：为什么 auxiliary attention loss 研究必须在 held-out\n      data 上 eval，以及 seen-data eval 如何系统性放大 training-inference gap。这本身可以成为一个\n      contribution，部分补偿 universality claim 的丧失。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR 衰减诊断\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B base model 上复现 Phase 1 GAR degradation 诊断\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.028\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.020\n      llama3_raw_gar_drop: 0.22\n      llama3_num_conversations: 5\n      llama3_num_turns: 10\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar: [0.028, 0.025, 0.024, 0.022, 0.021, 0.020, 0.019, 0.019, 0.018, 0.018]\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设 Llama-3 GAR decay 很弱（raw drop 10-30%）。Llama-3.1-8B 使用 GQA（8 KV heads\n      shared across 32 query heads），与 Qwen-2.5-7B 的 full MHA（28 独立 heads）架构显著不同。\n      GQA 中 KV heads 共享导致 attention pattern 的多样性受限——goal tokens 的注意力不会像 full MHA\n      那样因 per-head 独立衰减而急剧下降。Llama-3 的 RoPE 实现也不同（更长的 base frequency），\n      对长距离 position 的 attention 保持更好。结果：turn 1 GAR 本身就低于 Qwen（0.028 vs 0.042，\n      因为 GQA 的 attention 更分散），但衰减幅度远小（22% vs 70.8%）。这意味着 \"GAR decay is severe\n      and structural\" 在 Llama 上不成立——GAR 确实衰减，但属于温和的自然衰减而非 \"严重结构性现象\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 1 GAR Comparison (Qwen vs Llama)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 avg GAR\", \"0.0418\", \"0.028\"]\n          - [\"Mid turns avg GAR\", \"0.0122\", \"0.020\"]\n          - [\"Raw GAR drop\", \"70.8%\", \"22%\"]\n          - [\"Attention type\", \"Full MHA (28 heads)\", \"GQA (32q/8kv)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线 per-turn GAR curve (Qwen vs Llama)，Qwen 急剧下降，Llama 平缓下降\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama GAR decay 仅 22% 直接挑战 C1 的 \"严重结构性现象\" 定性。论文需要承认 GAR decay\n      severity 是架构依赖的：full MHA 更脆弱，GQA 通过 KV sharing 天然提供某种 attention\n      stability。这是有价值的 comparative finding，但削弱了 \"universal warning\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Qwen v7 训练设置 (MSE+gate_div)\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_training_gar_final: 0.22\n      llama3_training_ntp_final: 0.91\n      llama3_training_gate_mean: 0.945\n      llama3_training_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      llama3_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.35\n      llama3_training_inference_gap_x: 3.8\n      llama3_gate_direction: \"mixed — 18/32 layers show correct direction (attenuate more at late turns)\"\n      llama3_gate_diff_turn1_turn21_avg: 0.04\n      llama3_gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-50):plateau@0.01 B(gs50-200):slow_rise C(gs200+):converged@0.22\"\n      llama3_training_time_hours: 7.2\n      llama3_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_ppl: 2.85\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 Llama 训练表现与 Qwen 根本不同：(1) 训练 GAR 仅达 0.22（vs Qwen 0.48），\n      因为 GQA 架构下 gate 对 attention pattern 的调节能力更弱——KV heads 共享意味着 gate\n      调整单个 residual stream 对 attention 的影响被 diluted across 4 query heads per KV group；\n      (2) 推理 GAR 为 0.058（vs Qwen 0.016），gap 仅 3.8x（vs Qwen 30x）。这个缩小的 gap\n      有两个原因：a) Llama 的 GQA 使 attention pattern 在 teacher-forcing 和 generation 之间\n      更稳定（KV sharing 减少了分布偏移的自由度），b) Llama 的 training GAR 本身就低，\"可丢失\"\n      的空间更小；(3) 最致命的：gate direction 不完全反转——18/32 层 gate 在 late turns 确实\n      attenuate 更多（正确方向），只有 14/32 层反转。这意味着 NF1（反向 turn conditioning）\n      是 Qwen 特异性：Qwen full MHA 的 NTP 梯度在 gate 上产生更强的反向压力，GQA 的 grouped\n      structure 部分屏蔽了这个效应。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ThreadGate Training Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", \"0.48\", \"0.22\"]\n          - [\"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", \"0.016\", \"0.058\"]\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30x\", \"3.8x\"]\n          - [\"Gate direction reversed layers\", \"27/28\", \"14/32\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"2.63\", \"2.85\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 训练 GAR 曲线对比 (Qwen vs Llama)，Llama 收敛更慢且 plateau 更低\"\n      - \"Fig: 推理 gate profile per layer 对比，Llama 显示 mixed direction（非全部反转）\"\n    analysis: >\n      3.8x gap vs 30x gap 是 worst 档的核心打击。30x 是 paper 的 headline number 和 dramatic\n      effect 的来源。Llama 上仅 3.8x 意味着 distribution shift 的严重程度高度架构依赖：GQA\n      比 full MHA 更 robust。gate direction 不完全反转进一步说明 NF1 是 Qwen 特异性而非\n      universal mechanism。论文需要从 \"distribution shift is a fundamental barrier\" pivot 为\n      \"distribution shift severity is architecture-dependent, with full MHA being particularly\n      vulnerable\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only 训练\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"Llama-3.1-8B 上仅 LoRA 训练（无 gate），用于隔离 gating 贡献\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 7.0\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.92\n      llama3_lora_inference_dongre_mid_gar: 0.031\n      llama3_lora_inference_ours_mid_gar: 0.32\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.82\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama LoRA-only 的推理 Dongre GAR 为 0.031，显著低于 TG 的 0.058。差异 2.7pp 虽然\n      绝对值不大，但在 worst 档下这是关键信号：它意味着 gating 在 Llama 上有可测量的增量贡献，\n      与 Qwen 上 \"TG ≈ LoRA-only\"（差异<0.6pp）形成对比。原因：Llama GQA 的 attention pattern\n      对 residual stream 修改更敏感——gate 的 2-7% attenuation 在 GQA 下因 KV sharing 被放大\n      （每个 KV head 服务 4 个 query head，residual 上的微小变化被 4x amplified on attention）。\n      这颠覆了 C4 \"gating provides zero incremental contribution\" 的 universality——在 Llama 上\n      gating 确实有效，尽管效果仍然 modest。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama Gating Incremental Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Model variant\", \"Dongre mid GAR\", \"vs LoRA-only Δ(pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG\", \"0.058\", \"+2.7\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"0.031\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Base\", \"0.020\", \"-1.1\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Llama 3-way per-turn GAR curve，TG 和 LoRA-only 在 turn 5+ 有可见分离\"\n    analysis: >\n      TG vs LoRA-only 差异 2.7pp 在 Llama 上刚好超过 worst 档 threshold（>2pp）。这意味着\n      gating redundancy 不是 universal——是 Qwen 特异性。在 GQA 架构上 gate 的微弱调节被\n      KV sharing 机制放大，产生可测量的推理 GAR 增量。这迫使论文承认 gating 在某些架构上\n      有效，进一步削弱 \"universal failure\" 叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 三路 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"Llama Base/TG/LoRA-only 在 held-out data 上的 GAR + PPL 评估\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.020\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.55\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.058\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.85\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.031\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.82\n      llama3_tg_vs_lora_gap_pp: 2.7\n      llama3_tg_vs_base_gap_pp: 3.8\n      llama3_gating_has_incremental: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      三路 eval 汇总确认 worst 档的核心结论：(1) Llama 上 gating 有 2.7pp 增量（vs Qwen 的\n      ~0pp），打破 \"zero incremental contribution\" 的 universality；(2) Llama 整体\n      training-inference gap 远小于 Qwen，distribution shift 是 architecture-dependent；\n      (3) PPL 方面 TG 和 LoRA-only 差异微小（2.85 vs 2.82），gating 不损害语言建模质量\n      （与 Qwen 一致）。Llama eval 在 held-out data 上进行，消除了 Qwen eval 中 potential\n      contamination 问题。综合来看，Llama 数据支持 \"gating works marginally on GQA but fails\n      on full MHA\" 而非 \"gating universally fails\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model 3-Way Eval Summary\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"Qwen Base\", \"Qwen TG\", \"Qwen LO\", \"Llama Base\", \"Llama TG\", \"Llama LO\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Dongre mid GAR\", \"0.003\", \"0.016\", \"0.014\", \"0.020\", \"0.058\", \"0.031\"]\n          - [\"PPL\", \"4.23\", \"2.63\", \"2.63\", \"4.55\", \"2.85\", \"2.82\"]\n          - [\"TG-LO gap (pp)\", \"\", \"0.2\", \"\", \"\", \"2.7\", \"\"]\n          - [\"Train-Infer gap\", \"\", \"30x\", \"\", \"\", \"3.8x\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 跨模型 grouped bar chart (Qwen vs Llama x Base/TG/LO)，视觉化 gap 差异\"\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 per-turn GAR curve on held-out data\"\n    analysis: >\n      这张 cross-model 汇总表是 worst 档的核心 evidence，直接展示 universality 的崩塌。\n      论文主表需从 \"Table: Four-Way Ablation\" 改为 \"Table: Cross-Architecture Comparison\"，\n      把架构对比作为 primary narrative。reframe 策略：Qwen 的 30x gap 是 \"upper bound of\n      vulnerability\"，Llama 的 3.8x 是 \"lower bound\"，两者之间的差异由 attention architecture\n      (MHA vs GQA) 解释。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 梯度冲突分析\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"Llama 上计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_epoch0_avg_cos_sim: -0.02\n      llama3_epoch2_avg_cos_sim: 0.01\n      llama3_conflict_layer_pct_epoch0: 0.55\n      llama3_conflict_layer_pct_epoch2: 0.45\n      llama3_epoch0_avg_mag_ratio: 3.2\n      llama3_epoch2_avg_mag_ratio: 3.8\n      llama3_L31_mag_ratio_epoch2: 28\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设 Llama 梯度冲突远弱于 Qwen。原因：(1) GQA 中 gate 对每个 KV group 的梯度\n      是 4 个 query head 梯度的聚合——当 4 个 query head 的 NTP-GAR 冲突方向不完全一致时，\n      聚合后 cos_sim 趋近 0（冲突互相抵消），而 full MHA 每个 head 独立冲突，聚合后冲突更一致；\n      (2) Llama mag_ratio 仅 3.2-3.8x（vs Qwen 7.5-14.7x），因为 GQA 的 KV projection 参数\n      更少，NTP 对 gate 的间接梯度路径更短，NTP 压制效应更弱；(3) 到 epoch 2，Llama 的\n      avg cos_sim 甚至转正（0.01），说明 NTP 和 GAR 梯度在部分层达成了 alignment——这在 Qwen\n      上从未发生。这解释了为什么 Llama gate direction 不完全反转：NTP 梯度压制不够强，gate\n      能部分学到正确方向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient Conflict Cross-Model Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen Epoch0\", \"Qwen Epoch2\", \"Llama Epoch0\", \"Llama Epoch2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg cos_sim\", \"-0.089\", \"-0.042\", \"-0.02\", \"+0.01\"]\n          - [\"Conflict layers %\", \"79%\", \"67%\", \"55%\", \"45%\"]\n          - [\"Avg mag_ratio\", \"7.5x\", \"14.7x\", \"3.2x\", \"3.8x\"]\n          - [\"Deepest layer ratio\", \"135x\", \"1139x\", \"12x\", \"28x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 cos_sim per-layer heatmap，Qwen 中间层深红（强冲突），Llama 多为浅色（弱冲突/无冲突）\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 对比曲线，Qwen 指数增长 vs Llama 近似线性且低平\"\n    analysis: >\n      梯度冲突量化是 worst 档下最有 mechanistic 解释力的数据。它提供了 architecture-dependent\n      failure 的因果链：GQA → KV sharing → 梯度聚合抵消冲突 → gate 能部分学习正确方向 →\n      推理时 gate 产生可测量增量 → distribution shift gap 更小。这个因果链本身是有价值的\n      mechanistic contribution，可以作为 reframed paper 的核心 novelty 之一。论文可以 argue：\n      \"we provide the first quantitative evidence that attention architecture determines\n      the severity of NTP-auxiliary gradient conflict, explaining why distribution shift\n      is catastrophic for MHA but manageable for GQA\"。\n\n  - name: \"下游任务 Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: \"System prompt instruction retention accuracy 跨 turns 测量，关联 GAR 与任务表现\"\n    expected_results:\n      base_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.82\n      base_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.71\n      tg_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.83\n      tg_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.72\n      lora_turn1_instruction_acc: 0.83\n      lora_turn10_instruction_acc: 0.72\n      gar_task_correlation_r: 0.31\n      gar_task_correlation_p: 0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档下 GAR-task correlation 弱（r=0.31, p=0.08 不显著）。原因：(1) GAR 衡量的是\n      attention to goal tokens 的 raw proportion，但 LLM 的 instruction following 依赖\n      residual stream 中的 goal representation（Dongre 证明 AUC=0.98），不完全依赖实时\n      attention——即使 attention 衰减，信息仍在 residual stream 中；(2) instruction retention\n      accuracy 受多因素影响（context length, instruction complexity, turn content），GAR\n      只是其中一个 partial correlate；(3) TG/LoRA-only 与 base 的任务表现差异微小（1pp），\n      进一步确认 gating 在推理时无实质效果。GAR-task 弱相关在 worst 档下尤其 problematic，\n      因为它质疑 GAR 作为 proxy metric 的 validity（W3 的 reviewer concern 被实证支持），\n      削弱了整个 paper 围绕 GAR 构建的叙事。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction Retention Accuracy vs Turn\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", \"82%\", \"76%\", \"71%\", \"-11%\"]\n          - [\"TG\", \"83%\", \"77%\", \"72%\", \"-11%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", \"83%\", \"77%\", \"72%\", \"-11%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-Task Correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r\", \"0.31\"]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"0.08\"]\n          - [\"Conclusion\", \"Not significant at α=0.05\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scatter plot GAR vs instruction accuracy per turn，弱正相关，置信区间宽\"\n    analysis: >\n      GAR-task 弱相关是 worst 档的 \"soft blow\"——不致命但削弱 GAR 作为 sole proxy metric\n      的叙事说服力。论文需在 limitations 中显式承认：GAR captures attention allocation but\n      not necessarily functional impact, as residual stream preserves goal information\n      independently of attention（引用 Dongre probe AUC=0.98）。在 reframed paper 中，这\n      可以 pivot 为 \"the disconnect between attention-level metrics and task-level outcomes\n      is itself a finding — attention steering may be targeting the wrong bottleneck\"。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"e6760481